@tradition night-owls-cocoa
// Night owls' cocoa (FX14, 0.92.5 item 16; SW1's pitch): Saturday late, after film night and the observatory, Davi Keane
// makes a big pot of cocoa in the bow lounge with the lights down low. Behind WEEKEND_ON.
k: 463
title: Night owls' cocoa
when: weekly saturday
at: 22:30-23:30
min: 20
jitter: 15
where: 3 room Bow lounge: lounge-seat, bench
hold: 1
who: keane-davi always, night-owl 80%, late-sleeper 50%, stargazer 30%, everyone 8%
anim: drink
host: keane-davi
from: keane-davi

== mail
- Night owls' cocoa tomorrow from {time}, the bow lounge. Lights low, cocoa high. Pyjamas welcome.

== ask
- Night owls' cocoa after film night. Keane makes it far too sweet. It's perfect.   #funny
- Not ready for bed? Bow lounge, half ten. Cocoa and the stars.
- Keane's doing cocoa tonight. He's up anyway. He's always up.   #funny

== here
- Shh. Low voices. It's nearly midnight.
- Another mug? Go on, then. It's Saturday.   #warm
- Look at the windows. You never see them like this in the day.
- How is Keane this awake? It's eleven o'clock.   #funny

== thanks
- You curl up in the bow lounge with a mug. The lamps are low, the stars fill the curved windows, and Keane keeps the cocoa coming.

== chatter
- Stayed for night owls' cocoa. Slept like a stone. Recommended.   #funny
- Keane's cocoa is mostly sugar. Nobody's complained yet.   #funny
- The late hour in the bow lounge is the best one of the week.   #warm
